/// The iteration count used when an app does not choose one.
///
/// PBKDF2 is not memory-hard, so it is weaker per unit of work than
/// argon2id against GPU attackers; the iteration count compensates and this
/// figure tracks current OWASP guidance for PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256.
pub const DEFAULT_PBKDF2_ITERATIONS: u32 = 600_000;

